    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/633bc3c0db463d60b46e4fe844be4460.avif?t=1723076856\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/9b3c4daf8f556a04bd545d385d3ff78f.webp?t=1723076856\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Untie the Fabrics of a Forgotten Realm</strong></h2><br>Built between engulfing arms of whispering seas and upon overambitious dreams, the isle realm of Foghorn now lies in ruin. Devoid of it's crown, land is clogged in filth, vanity and petrifying fear. <br><br>Crave is a classically styled 2D action adventure through a vast interconnected world. Explore gnarled alleys and corners of a decaying realm by utilizing your carnivores arsenal.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/764bafdf96a0989c3442fbc2f18c308c.poster.avif?t=1723076856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/764bafdf96a0989c3442fbc2f18c308c.webm?t=1723076856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/764bafdf96a0989c3442fbc2f18c308c.mp4?t=1723076856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/9b3c4daf8f556a04bd545d385d3ff78f.webp?t=1723076856\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic 2D side scrolling action adventure.<br></li><li>Tightly refined controls for challenging combat and platforming action. <br></li><li>Explore mossy bathhouses, cabaret theatre or a moldy greenhouse within a vast interconnected world. <br></li><li>Rediscover and utilize your carnivore abilities assisting you in both combat and exploration.  <br></li><li>Devour your adversaries, whether they're men or beasts. Utilize their abilities in combat. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/df26a1268f07de907f65e4dd43df9259.poster.avif?t=1723076856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/df26a1268f07de907f65e4dd43df9259.webm?t=1723076856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/df26a1268f07de907f65e4dd43df9259.mp4?t=1723076856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Chart the layout of the kingdom using your acute sense of smell and urination of claimed territories. <br></li><li>Equip various trinkets and talismans for a further customization of your playstyle. <br></li><li>Hand drawn 2D traditional animation style.<br></li><li>Original and evocative soundtrack, composed by Sky To Speak. </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/d23b8ca6abe2a1c1008596a97fc82cf1.poster.avif?t=1723076856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/d23b8ca6abe2a1c1008596a97fc82cf1.webm?t=1723076856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/9b3c4daf8f556a04bd545d385d3ff78f.webp?t=1723076856\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Supported using public funding by Slovak Arts Council</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_c